              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo, būlī ng'wene ū mu bing'we akūshiponya kūle ī shiikolile shakwe sha feza, nī sha zahabu, īsho ng'washibeeja na makono ging'we ga shibi.",
